 154:Core/Src/can.c **** //
 155:Core/Src/can.c **** 
 156:Core/Src/can.c **** 
 157:Core/Src/can.c **** /// CAN Command Packet Structure ///
 158:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 16 bit position command, between -4*pi and 4*pi
 159:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit velocity command, between -30 and 30 rad/s
 160:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit kp, between 0 and 500 N-m/rad
 161:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit kd, between 0 and 100 N-m*s/rad
 162:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit feed forward torque, between -18 and 18 N-m
 163:Core/Src/can.c **** /// CAN Packet is 8 8-bit words
 164:Core/Src/can.c **** /// Formatted as follows.  For each quantity, bit 0 is LSB
 165:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 0: [position[15-8]]
 166:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 1: [position[7-0]]
 167:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 2: [velocity[11-4]]
 168:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 3: [velocity[3-0], kp[11-8]]
 169:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 4: [kp[7-0]]
 170:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 5: [kd[11-4]]
 171:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 6: [kd[3-0], torque[11-8]]
 172:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 7: [torque[7-0]]
 173:Core/Src/can.c **** /* =========================================================================
 174:Core/Src/can.c ****  * CÁC HÀM DÀNH CHO MASTER
 175:Core/Src/can.c ****  * ========================================================================= */
 176:Core/Src/can.c **** 
 177:Core/Src/can.c **** // MASTER GỬI LỆNH: Đóng gói dữ liệu điều khiển để gửi xuống Slave
