 211:Core/Src/can.c **** /// unpack_cmd Reply Packet Structure ///
 212:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 16 bit position, between -4*pi and 4*pi
 213:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit velocity, between -30 and 30 rad/s
 214:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit current, between -40 and 40;
 215:Core/Src/can.c **** /// CAN Packet is 5 8-bit words
 216:Core/Src/can.c **** /// Formatted as follows.  For each quantity, bit 0 is LSB
 217:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 0: [position[15-8]]
 218:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 1: [position[7-0]]
 219:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 2: [velocity[11-4]]
 220:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 3: [velocity[3-0], current[11-8]]
 221:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 4: [current[7-0]]
 222:Core/Src/can.c **** /* =========================================================================
 223:Core/Src/can.c ****  * CÁC HÀM DÀNH CHO SLAVE (MOTOR CONTROLLER)
 224:Core/Src/can.c ****  * ========================================================================= */
 225:Core/Src/can.c **** 
 226:Core/Src/can.c **** 
